  "article": {
    "hero": {
      "title": "👕 Clothing Brand Name Generator",
      "tagline": "Names for a clothing line, from Late Bus Club to Hartley & Sons."
    },
    "intro": "A good clothing brand name is short, easy to say and looks good on a label: a pun, an image, a heritage-style name or your own. This **clothing brand name generator** gives you names in eight styles, from punny to heritage, and you can check each one is free before you print a single tag.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "heading": "Eight good clothing brand names",
        "content": "<p>All eight came from the generator, across its styles:</p><ul><li><strong>Thread Carefully</strong>: a pun that also sounds like a brand value.</li><li><strong>Knit Wit</strong>: short and funny, for knitwear.</li><li><strong>Studio Sorrel</strong>: modern and soft, with a plant name in it.</li><li><strong>The Overcast Label</strong>: a calm, moody name for minimalist basics.</li><li><strong>Night Bus Home Club</strong>: streetwear named after a shared experience.</li><li><strong>Rhinestone Era</strong>: Y2K style, all sparkle and nostalgia.</li><li><strong>Atelier Duval</strong>: luxury with a French workshop word: an atelier is a designer's studio.</li><li><strong>The Tannery Lane Outfitters</strong>: heritage style, with a street name and an old trade.</li></ul>"
      },
      {
        "heading": "Picking a style for your label",
